:name: One trainer weapon machine
:description: Creates machine $name on the existing CAN hub "canHub" and loads $elf.

# Inputs: $name, $elf. The caller then pins the unique ID (see single.resc /
# lane.resc), because with no stored config the firmware derives its CAN node
# ID from it: node = 1 + (sum of the 12 UID bytes) mod 127.

mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/trainer_board.repl
connector Connect sysbus.fdcan1 canHub

sysbus LoadELF $elf
cpu EnableZephyrMode "CONFIG_TICKLESS_KERNEL"
cpu VectorTableOffset `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "_vector_table"`
